### List angle presets
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/angle-preset HTTP/1.1

### List with client filter
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/angle-preset?client=CLIENT_A HTTP/1.1

### Create angle preset — happy path (replace ids)
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/angle-preset HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Standard e-commerce pack",
  "client": "CLIENT_A",
  "entries": [
    {
      "clientAngleId": "000000000000000000000001",
      "imageSpecs": [
        {
          "angleTechnicalSpecificationId": "000000000000000000000002",
          "namingPattern": "${barcode}_front.${ext}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### Create — missing entries
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/angle-preset HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Empty preset",
  "client": "CLIENT_A",
  "entries": []
}

### Create — missing naming pattern
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/angle-preset HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "No naming pattern",
  "client": "CLIENT_A",
  "entries": [
    {
      "clientAngleId": "000000000000000000000001",
      "imageSpecs": [
        {
          "angleTechnicalSpecificationId": "000000000000000000000002",
          "namingPattern": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### Get by id — replace with real id
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/angle-preset/000000000000000000000000 HTTP/1.1

### Update preset — replace with real id
PATCH http://localhost:7015/api/v1/angle-preset/000000000000000000000000 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated preset name"
}

### Delete by id — replace with real id
DELETE http://localhost:7015/api/v1/angle-preset/000000000000000000000000 HTTP/1.1
